"apps.budgetScope" = "The selected apps/websites share one daily budget, not a separate budget each and not total internet traffic. After Apple's threshold callback, they are shielded until the next daily interval starts. On iOS 16–17.3 counting begins when monitoring starts. Real-device testing is required.";
"apps.apply" = "Apply selected restrictions";
"apps.locked" = "During your commitment you can add blocks or strengthen limits, but cannot remove selections, increase time or weaken always-block mode. Older iOS versions cannot edit a running daily budget; always-block tightening is available.";
