"commitment.confirmBody %lld" = "You choose %lld days without early self-release inside Hisn. This does not make Hisn undeletable or stop revocation in Apple settings. Keep access to essential services. Protection depends on separately enabled layers.";
"commitment.scope" = "A voluntary app-level lock, not a device-owner lock. Device erasure, removal, permission revocation and clock changes across relaunch can bypass it. DNS and Safari stay enabled independently; ending a plan does not automatically turn them off.";
"commitment.noLayer" = "No blocking configuration was confirmed. A commitment alone blocks nothing: enable Screen Time, Safari or DNS and check again.";
